{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/ad6c5a81f1d70c0a167e09261f433f05.avif?t=1768983572\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras_big/ad6c5a81f1d70c0a167e09261f433f05.webp?t=1768983572 width=1560 height=417 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/a7c1ed9ede4e9e7afe7b084b649bd75c.avif?t=1768983572\" width=1500 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/c1d16f68712d18677d7746884d3f9fc0.poster.avif?t=1768983572\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/c1d16f68712d18677d7746884d3f9fc0.webm?t=1768983572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/c1d16f68712d18677d7746884d3f9fc0.mp4?t=1768983572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Withstand or embrace the infection inside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront the darkness within the ship\u2026 and your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/2a3e6ad2f4a9332f8679b7a585b353c3.avif?t=1768983572\" width=1500 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/fc7f9a5ff062914a1dfecc4108068965.poster.avif?t=1768983572\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/fc7f9a5ff062914a1dfecc4108068965.webm?t=1768983572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/fc7f9a5ff062914a1dfecc4108068965.mp4?t=1768983572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inhabit a full-body avatar. Use your Medical Tricorder to track your condition, treating your infection with a Hypospray, or embracing its mutations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/147e1585c97ce2881e2bee4585ff6493.avif?t=1768983572\" width=1500 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/7735c32cb55144345feb2c99dd6a28ca.poster.avif?t=1768983572\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/7735c32cb55144345feb2c99dd6a28ca.webm?t=1768983572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/7735c32cb55144345feb2c99dd6a28ca.mp4?t=1768983572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage or exploit your mutation\u2019s side effects to unlock powerful but unstable abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/b420521b681b8f47550e8447dfb38d98.avif?t=1768983572\" width=1500 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/8e4777cc4440572592396b1f867f49a7.poster.avif?t=1768983572\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/8e4777cc4440572592396b1f867f49a7.webm?t=1768983572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/8e4777cc4440572592396b1f867f49a7.mp4?t=1768983572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a Vulcan. Rational, disciplined, in control. But your sanity and resolve are faltering. Something aboard is learning your fears and using them against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/6f7ca5a54d695c45ec259836ea376ce4.avif?t=1768983572\" width=1500 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/9862f8bbcf9e8de0393100482ecd759e.poster.avif?t=1768983572\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/9862f8bbcf9e8de0393100482ecd759e.webm?t=1768983572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/9862f8bbcf9e8de0393100482ecd759e.mp4?t=1768983572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Phaser, stealth, or Vulcan nerve pinch to deal with threats. Use your Tricorder to scan for dangers and uncover vital resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/2142a52bbdf0a9cede4b4a8e887500f4.avif?t=1768983572\" width=1500 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/a42fcbea6eb7da030229cb33175aff25.poster.avif?t=1768983572\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/a42fcbea6eb7da030229cb33175aff25.webm?t=1768983572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/a42fcbea6eb7da030229cb33175aff25.mp4?t=1768983572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your VR hands to interact with the ship, crafting tools and weapons essential for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/17f4a837bed65b7b2109ee44d80fef44.avif?t=1768983572\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a Vulcan Starfleet officer, sent on a special mission aboard the U.S.S. Lumen, but something has gone horribly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>There\u2019s no crew in sight, and an unknown entity has infested the ship. Now it\u2019s inside your body, physically mutating you, unlocking dangerous new abilities at the cost of your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras/0823b863574dad407fc4e3414ea896bd.avif?t=1768983572\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954580/extras_big/0823b863574dad407fc4e3414ea896bd.webp?t=1768983572 width=1560 height=551 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images